#, no-wrap
msgid "How information is organized in GRSciColl"
msgstr "GRSciColl 中資訊的如何組織"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/entities.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this video (04:15), GBIF Data Administrator, Marie Grosjean, describes how information is organized in GRSciColl.   \n"
"If you are unable to watch the embedded Vimeo video, you can download it locally on the xref:downloads.adoc[Files for download] page.\n"
msgstr "在這段影片（04:15）中，GBIF 資料管理員 Marie Grosjean 說明了 GRSciColl 中資訊的組織方式。   \n"
"若您無法觀看嵌入的 Vimeo 影片，可至 xref:downloads.adoc[可下載檔案] 頁面將影片下載至本機。\n"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/entities.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "grscicoll::module1-section1-Slide1.png"
msgstr "grscicoll::module1-section1-Slide1.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/entities.adoc:29
msgid "The content of GRSciColl centers around describing physical scientific collections: their content, location, contact information, and their associated institutions. The two types of entries that you will see on GRSciColl are *institutions* and *collections*."
msgstr "GRSciColl 的內容主要圍繞著描述實體科學館藏：其內容、地點、聯絡資訊以及相關機構。您在 GRSciColl 上會看到兩種類型的條目：*機構* 和 *館藏*。"

